<title>CANADA: DBRS puts CP unit Marathon under review.</title>
<headline>DBRS puts CP unit Marathon under review.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service said on Friday that it has placed Marathon Realty Co Ltd, a unit of Canadian Pacific Ltd, under review with developing implications.</p>
<p>The rating agency said its decision followed the announcement earlier today that Marathon will be sold to a joint venture company owned by General Electric Capital Corp and Oxford Properties Group Inc.</p>
<p>The transaction is valued at C$952 million plus assumed debt.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
